EmailMorgenholtBody=The Peruvian government has communicated their suspicions that American Bruce Morgenholt was kidnapped by an organization known as the "People's Voice". The group itself has not released any public statements.
EmailMorgenholtDate=June 23, 2007
EmailMorgenholtFrom=WNM News Wire
EmailMorgenholtSubject="People's Voice" Suspected in Morgenholt Kidnapping
